WEBVTT

00:00:07.383 --> 00:00:08.968
A soldier is a sword.

00:00:09.218 --> 00:00:12.513
Its utility is at its wielder's discretion.

00:00:12.763 --> 00:00:16.893
We simply need to be mighty swords.

00:00:18.311 --> 00:00:23.357
Our wielder will do anything to achieve her aim.

00:00:23.608 --> 00:00:28.946
Even if her swords become
bloodstained or broken in the process...

00:00:38.372 --> 00:00:42.501
That is the one thing that worries me a bit...

00:00:45.213 --> 00:00:51.802
<i>No matter what might await us there</i>

00:00:52.053 --> 00:01:00.478
<i>I'll go to unexplored territory with you</i>

00:01:08.736 --> 00:01:16.786
<i>I just had a short dream</i>

00:01:17.036 --> 00:01:21.415
<i>In it, I saw your back</i>

00:01:21.666 --> 00:01:27.588
<i>Was it the past? The future?</i>

00:01:27.838 --> 00:01:38.349
<i>Ignore the needle on that meter
pointing to the red zone</i>

00:01:38.599 --> 00:01:41.477
<i>And go where the tailwinds
and your feelings point you</i>

00:01:41.727 --> 00:01:47.650
<i>Every time I flap my wings, it makes me realize</i>

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:53.197
<i>That there are skies
I'll never be able to see again</i>

00:01:53.447 --> 00:01:58.703
<i>But if you still want to take flight</i>

00:01:58.953 --> 00:02:05.501
<i>Then I will be your wings</i>

00:02:33.612 --> 00:02:38.617
<i>P</i> It's your birthday! Be happy! <i>P</i>

00:02:38.868 --> 00:02:40.953
Congratulations, Fam!

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:23.371
Fan'!

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:30.127
Huh?

00:03:35.049 --> 00:03:36.926
You're really gonna leave?

00:03:37.176 --> 00:03:40.971
We fulfilled our agreement and gathered
fifteen Federation ships, after all.

00:03:41.222 --> 00:03:43.766
Yeah, but...

00:03:44.016 --> 00:03:48.771
Okay. I'll let the people in Kartoffel
know you're staying behind.

00:03:50.314 --> 00:03:53.818
I can't fly without you, Gisey.

00:03:54.068 --> 00:03:56.112
Then just ask Princess Millia.

00:03:57.279 --> 00:04:00.950
She has thorough knowledge
and good judgment.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.743
Unlike me.

00:04:02.993 --> 00:04:07.665
I'm not fit to be your Navi, Fam...

00:04:07.915 --> 00:04:10.042
You're better off with Princess Millia.

00:04:10.292 --> 00:04:13.921
--But you're amazing, Gisey!
--I'm not. I'm nothing...

00:04:14.171 --> 00:04:15.172
Don't talk like that!

00:04:15.423 --> 00:04:17.466
What would you know?!

00:04:27.643 --> 00:04:31.021
I heard what happened.
Talk about a bad first impression!

00:04:31.272 --> 00:04:34.400
Encountering Glacies wasn't part of the plan.

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:37.945
We violated their airspace
and fought inside their territory...

00:04:38.195 --> 00:04:40.656
We must seem like total savages!

00:04:40.906 --> 00:04:42.324
Conflict is unavoidable?

00:04:42.575 --> 00:04:47.037
Seems that way. Even if we went
bearing the Silvius as a gift...

00:04:48.706 --> 00:04:49.957
Where's Vincent?

00:04:50.207 --> 00:04:51.500
On his way now.

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.627
I bet he'll be shocked

00:04:53.878 --> 00:04:57.631
when he sees the invincible
Silvius all beat up like this...

00:04:57.882 --> 00:05:00.759
Had the captain of our Vanship
squadron actually been here,

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:04.180
we might have avoided taking so much damage.

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:06.849
We really could have used your help earlier.

00:05:07.099 --> 00:05:09.185
Yeah, you're right...

00:05:10.686 --> 00:05:12.313
Have you seen Millia?

00:05:24.033 --> 00:05:26.202
I burned it!

00:05:27.703 --> 00:05:29.288
Teddy!

00:05:33.709 --> 00:05:36.378
Are you trying to avoid Fam?

00:05:36.629 --> 00:05:38.464
I'm too ashamed to face her.

00:05:38.714 --> 00:05:41.467
But it wasn't your fault, Princess...

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:47.890
Tell me... What should I do at a time like this?

00:05:49.266 --> 00:05:53.437
My sister would've known just what to do.

00:05:56.106 --> 00:05:58.108
Your soup's gettin' cold.

00:06:05.449 --> 00:06:07.117
Delicious...

00:06:14.833 --> 00:06:15.918
Verify check!

00:06:16.168 --> 00:06:17.670
A-O K!

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:19.964
L9l1ace...!

00:06:36.647 --> 00:06:38.357
Yahoo!

00:06:41.318 --> 00:06:44.363
Come on, Dio! Quit playin' around!

00:06:44.613 --> 00:06:47.658
--We're supposed to head to the border!
--I know that!

00:06:47.908 --> 00:06:50.077
No you don't! You don't know at all!

00:06:50.327 --> 00:06:51.620
Say something, Fam!

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:53.789
Hey! Fam!

00:07:30.743 --> 00:07:32.953
Returning to base.

00:07:37.791 --> 00:07:39.251
Wow.

00:07:39.501 --> 00:07:42.171
They won't bother anyone near the border,
just as long as they're outside it.

00:07:42.421 --> 00:07:45.674
Wouldn't be so sure. They could
come back with reinforcements.

00:07:45.924 --> 00:07:48.510
Yikes! We better recover this quick, then!

00:07:50.304 --> 00:07:52.806
Just a few tweaks and she'll fly again!

00:07:53.057 --> 00:07:55.768
Good job bringing her down, Fam.

00:07:56.018 --> 00:07:57.519
Mm.

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:01.899
Fam seems kinda glum.

00:08:02.149 --> 00:08:07.196
Well, fighting's a part of life on the Silvius.

00:08:07.446 --> 00:08:13.452
They can leave any time they want.
They ain't part of the crew to begin with.

00:08:13.702 --> 00:08:14.662
Call it in, Elio.

00:08:14.912 --> 00:08:16.580
Oh, right!

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.209
Recirculation valve is repaired.

00:08:20.459 --> 00:08:22.753
Understood! Start the engine!

00:08:23.003 --> 00:08:24.588
Starting engine!

00:08:24.838 --> 00:08:29.677
Output increasing! 10%! 20%! 40%!

00:08:29.927 --> 00:08:31.512
Liftoff!

00:08:37.851 --> 00:08:40.020
Returning to Kartoffel?

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:42.231
Yeah.

00:08:42.481 --> 00:08:43.982
How about you?

00:08:47.319 --> 00:08:50.322
I was always part of the Silvius' crew.

00:08:50.572 --> 00:08:52.950
My playtime's over now.

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.870
I had lots of fun flying with you guys.

00:08:57.121 --> 00:08:59.039
Oh...

00:08:59.289 --> 00:09:02.501
Gisey says she wants to go back.

00:09:02.751 --> 00:09:04.920
We set out at 1500 hours.

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:08.257
We'll be going that way for supplies.
We can drop you off nearby.

00:09:08.507 --> 00:09:10.217
Thank you.

00:09:11.468 --> 00:09:12.970
Thank you for everything.

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:14.263
Giselle...

00:09:14.513 --> 00:09:17.933
Do you remember what I told you before?

00:09:18.183 --> 00:09:21.979
That sometimes it's important
to say what's on your mind...

00:09:26.859 --> 00:09:29.319
I took Gisey for granted.

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:33.157
I got too used to her always being there.

00:09:33.407 --> 00:09:36.952
I never realized how she felt...

00:09:37.202 --> 00:09:39.663
I had someone like that too.

00:09:39.913 --> 00:09:41.707
He was really important to me.

00:09:41.957 --> 00:09:47.588
I assumed that he'd always be there
for me, and that he felt the same way.

00:09:47.838 --> 00:09:54.428
But I don't know how he really felt,
or if he knew how I felt...

00:09:54.678 --> 00:09:57.139
I'll never know now.

00:10:02.978 --> 00:10:06.440
Princess! It's on fire! It's on fire!

00:10:10.027 --> 00:10:11.570
Let me have it!

00:10:22.164 --> 00:10:24.333
--Thank you...
--Not at all.

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:30.088
Potato pancakes?

00:10:30.339 --> 00:10:34.718
Y-Yes. They're Pam's favorite and all...

00:10:36.011 --> 00:10:38.305
Good food can cheer people up, right?

00:10:38.555 --> 00:10:40.891
I was hoping you could eat them together...

00:10:42.142 --> 00:10:43.477
I'm sorry.

00:10:43.727 --> 00:10:47.147
This was only a Turan issue...
An issue between two countries...

00:10:47.397 --> 00:10:52.653
Yet I dragged you both into it
and caused you so much trouble...

00:10:52.903 --> 00:10:56.073
I'm sorry! I'm truly sorry!

00:10:56.323 --> 00:10:58.283
Th-That's not...!

00:10:58.534 --> 00:11:00.494
Th-There's no need for you to apologize!

00:11:00.744 --> 00:11:04.623
Fam just... Fam just can't ignore you--

00:11:06.041 --> 00:11:08.544
My sister absolutely must survive!

00:11:08.794 --> 00:11:10.921
I'll be your wings!

00:11:12.172 --> 00:11:15.133
We won't need to stay on the Silvius anymore.

00:11:15.384 --> 00:11:17.302
We can go back to Kartoffel.

00:11:17.553 --> 00:11:22.516
I'm not fit to be your Navi, Fam...

00:11:22.766 --> 00:11:25.310
You're better off with Princess Millia.

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:32.818
Fam just can't ignore you in your time of need.

00:11:33.068 --> 00:11:34.945
Giselle?

00:11:35.195 --> 00:11:38.657
I only thought about myself...

00:11:38.907 --> 00:11:41.159
I said those horrible things to Fam...

00:11:43.036 --> 00:11:45.747
I never meant to make her feel that way...

00:11:49.376 --> 00:11:50.669
<i>Z I</i>

00:11:50.919 --> 00:11:53.005
I want to cheer Fam up!

00:11:53.255 --> 00:11:57.009
I don't like it when Fam is feeling down either!

00:11:58.051 --> 00:12:00.345
It sounds like we have Fam on the brain!

00:12:00.596 --> 00:12:05.434
--Yeah! --Can you think of
anything that might cheer her up?

00:12:06.935 --> 00:12:07.853
Oh!

00:12:08.103 --> 00:12:10.314
Today is Pam's birthday...!

00:12:10.564 --> 00:12:11.398
Really?

00:12:11.648 --> 00:12:15.277
I can't believe I forgot...

00:12:15.527 --> 00:12:18.739
The day isn't over yet, Giselle.

00:12:21.575 --> 00:12:22.951
Right!

00:12:38.258 --> 00:12:41.845
Where are they?!

00:12:42.095 --> 00:12:44.556
They're both nowhere to be found...

00:12:48.894 --> 00:12:50.604
Umm...

00:12:57.861 --> 00:13:00.072
Talk about a tall order...

00:13:00.322 --> 00:13:02.866
Okay, then. First is...

00:13:04.826 --> 00:13:06.536
They jumped ship.

00:13:14.044 --> 00:13:16.171
Couldn't you have put it differently?

00:13:16.421 --> 00:13:17.965
Well, it's the truth.

00:13:28.183 --> 00:13:31.061
The best ones are nicely
shaped with still-fresh stems.

00:13:31.311 --> 00:13:32.396
It smells wonderful!

00:13:32.646 --> 00:13:36.066
We'll take one gallon of milk and all
the oranges and potatoes you have!

00:13:36.316 --> 00:13:38.485
"A goat!
"A goat!

00:13:40.153 --> 00:13:41.822
Let's g0, 6559)'!

00:13:42.072 --> 00:13:44.032
Wait, Fam!

00:13:46.952 --> 00:13:48.620
Shall we go?

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:50.330
Yes.

00:13:57.546 --> 00:13:59.423
Quit slackin' off!

00:14:02.384 --> 00:14:06.430
Oh, cool! The mast topper! Check it out!

00:14:12.894 --> 00:14:14.688
Fam! Pass it!

00:14:17.649 --> 00:14:19.192
Pass it here!

00:14:20.652 --> 00:14:22.237
Elio!

00:14:22.487 --> 00:14:24.072
Get it!

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.493
Go long!

00:14:49.931 --> 00:14:52.642
--Let's start by evening the score.
--Yeah!

00:14:52.893 --> 00:14:55.353
Hey! There's a hockey game goin' on!

00:15:23.131 --> 00:15:23.882
What's going on?

00:15:24.132 --> 00:15:26.051
One hell of a game, that's what!

00:15:26.301 --> 00:15:28.303
OI' Pam's got a real knack--

00:15:28.553 --> 00:15:30.305
C-Captain!

00:16:04.214 --> 00:16:05.423
Close, but no cigar!

00:16:05.674 --> 00:16:07.592
--I'm just getting started!
--Okay! Let's do it, Fam!

00:16:07.843 --> 00:16:09.886
Yeah!

00:16:10.137 --> 00:16:12.013
Fam Fan Fan?

00:16:12.264 --> 00:16:14.558
I wish I had a cooler name.

00:16:14.808 --> 00:16:17.018
Fritz and the others say
it sounds like a pet's name.

00:16:17.269 --> 00:16:20.105
I like it. Fam Fan Fan.

00:16:22.232 --> 00:16:24.151
You do?

00:16:24.401 --> 00:16:26.194
Quit it!

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:32.284
Fam...

00:16:35.078 --> 00:16:37.956
Geez! You're gonna fall, Birdbrain!

00:16:40.584 --> 00:16:41.835
Dad!

00:16:42.085 --> 00:16:44.504
Atamora!

00:16:44.754 --> 00:16:46.590
<i>We've always been together...</i>

00:16:49.301 --> 00:16:51.261
<i>Just like sisters...</i>

00:17:10.155 --> 00:17:12.365
To soar through those skies...

00:17:12.616 --> 00:17:14.201
To become the wind...

00:17:14.451 --> 00:17:16.828
That's my...

00:17:17.078 --> 00:17:19.164
...our dream.

00:17:20.207 --> 00:17:21.750
Fan'!

00:17:22.959 --> 00:17:24.878
Sorry!

00:17:33.053 --> 00:17:34.721
(iiseY!

00:17:45.148 --> 00:17:47.859
Fam... I'm...

00:17:48.985 --> 00:17:50.654
Welcome back!

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:54.074
I'm home!

00:17:59.788 --> 00:18:01.706
Won't you play too, Princess Millia?

00:18:01.957 --> 00:18:03.750
M-Me?

00:18:05.502 --> 00:18:08.046
Fam! We have another player!

00:18:08.296 --> 00:18:09.839
Huh?

00:18:10.882 --> 00:18:11.675
Millia!

00:18:11.925 --> 00:18:13.218
Six players now?

00:18:13.468 --> 00:18:16.263
Then we need extra teammates too!

00:18:17.472 --> 00:18:19.766
Don't mind if we do.

00:18:29.192 --> 00:18:30.652
L~\ \ K \\\ !

00:18:32.654 --> 00:18:35.198
<i>I thought I had lost everything.</i>

00:18:38.076 --> 00:18:41.663
<i>I wanted to help her.
Because it's sad being all alone...</i>

00:18:43.832 --> 00:18:47.544
<i>I wanted to be there for her. To support her...</i>

00:18:58.513 --> 00:19:02.684
<i>From now on, we'll always
be there for each other!</i>

00:19:02.934 --> 00:19:04.602
Gimme your best shot!

00:19:04.853 --> 00:19:06.521
Millia! Heads up!

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:10.150
Move aside!

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:12.319
Princess?! Wh-What am l...?!

00:19:12.569 --> 00:19:14.904
I don't know what to do!

00:19:31.421 --> 00:19:33.381
"GiSey!
“Right!

00:19:52.650 --> 00:19:55.278
<i>Together with Gisey...</i>

00:19:55.528 --> 00:19:57.364
<i>For Millia!</i>

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:00.533
<i>Together with</i> Fam...

00:20:02.285 --> 00:20:05.163
<i>For another Grand Race someday!</i>

00:20:15.423 --> 00:20:16.549
Ready, start!

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:20.303
<i>P</i> It's your birthday! Be happy! <i>P</i>

00:20:20.553 --> 00:20:24.474
P You're born, you live,
and back to dust you go! <i>P</i>

00:20:24.724 --> 00:20:26.643
P Congratulations, congratulations! <i>P</i>

00:20:26.893 --> 00:20:33.233
P Happy birthday, dear Fam! <i>P</i>

00:20:33.483 --> 00:20:34.943
Fam.

00:20:53.711 --> 00:20:56.131
Okay! Let's eat up before it gets cold!

00:20:56.381 --> 00:20:58.216
Cheers to Pam's tears!

00:20:58.466 --> 00:21:00.385
Cheers!

00:21:02.554 --> 00:21:04.931
I'm sorry. It was a secret.

00:21:06.349 --> 00:21:09.477
We covertly put this all together!

00:21:13.898 --> 00:21:16.067
Here you are, Fam!

00:21:16.317 --> 00:21:20.155
Congratulations. You successfully
captured fifteen battleships.

00:21:20.405 --> 00:21:22.449
Are you really gonna leave?

00:21:25.535 --> 00:21:27.537
Our Skyfish hunt isn't over yet.

00:21:27.787 --> 00:21:29.956
I turned 16 today.

00:21:32.459 --> 00:21:35.253
We still have to beat up the
Federation and take back Turan!

00:21:35.503 --> 00:21:37.589
I'm staying right here!

00:21:39.382 --> 00:21:41.885
A birthday present from me.

00:21:45.513 --> 00:21:48.475
Now you're part of the Silvius' crew too!

00:21:51.436 --> 00:21:53.688
Oh, sounds lively!

00:21:57.609 --> 00:22:00.862
A welcome party for me? You shouldn't have.

00:22:01.112 --> 00:22:02.697
Vincent!

00:22:02.947 --> 00:22:05.533
Excellent work, Tatiana.

00:22:05.783 --> 00:22:06.701
Who are you?

00:22:06.951 --> 00:22:08.036
Forgive me.

00:22:08.286 --> 00:22:10.413
I am the Commander-in-Chief
of the Vanguard Unit

00:22:10.663 --> 00:22:12.916
of the United Kingdom of Anatoray-Disith...

00:22:13.166 --> 00:22:15.710
...Vincent Alzey.

00:22:20.215 --> 00:22:22.050
It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance...

00:22:22.300 --> 00:22:26.930
...Princess Millia, royal representative
of the refugee government of Turan.

00:22:31.017 --> 00:22:36.606
<i>How high are the skies,</i>

00:22:36.856 --> 00:22:42.654
<i>how strong are the winds,</i>

00:22:42.904 --> 00:22:48.493
<i>how clear are the waters</i>

00:22:48.743 --> 00:22:55.792
<i>you hold in your heart?</i>

00:22:57.001 --> 00:23:08.471
<i>One day I want to be the palm
of your hand and catch your tears</i>

00:23:08.721 --> 00:23:20.567
<i>I want us to share the
same sorrows, the same air</i>

00:23:20.817 --> 00:23:26.406
<i>I'll point the prow of this departing ship</i>

00:23:26.656 --> 00:23:35.206
<i>Right your way with no hesitation</i>

00:23:35.456 --> 00:23:41.170
<i>Let's raise the mast in this sea of wind</i>

00:23:41.421 --> 00:23:46.968
<i>And set sail on these waves of clouds</i>

00:23:47.218 --> 00:23:52.724
<i>With the faraway stars for a compass</i>

00:23:52.974 --> 00:24:00.648
<i>I'll head beyond the horizon with you</i>

00:24:03.693 --> 00:24:06.029
<i>Thanks so much for today, guys!</i>

00:24:06.279 --> 00:24:07.614
<i>You're welcome!</i>

00:24:07.864 --> 00:24:11.868
<i>Say, now that you're sixteen years old,
is there anyone who interests you?</i>

00:24:12.118 --> 00:24:13.578
<i>“Interests me?
--Well?</i>

00:24:13.828 --> 00:24:16.914
<i>It's such a sudden question... Hmm...</i>

00:24:17.165 --> 00:24:18.082
<i>Oh! There is one person!</i>

00:24:18.333 --> 00:24:20.168
<i>Oh?! R-Really?! Who is it?!</i>

00:24:20.418 --> 00:24:22.837
<i>That old Ades Federation admiral!</i>

00:24:23.087 --> 00:24:24.547
O-Oh...

00:24:24.797 --> 00:24:28.259
<i>I suppose talking about love is out
of the question for you for a while...</i>
